PN,38401
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786029507
OL,3,CFirst human volunteers recruited for
OL,4,Cground breaking vaccine
OL,6,FScientists at the University of Oxford
OL,7,Fare recruiting the first human
OL,8,Fvolunteers to trial an experimental
OL,9,Fvaccine against a new type of Ebola
OL,10,Fvirus.
OL,12,FThe vaccine is being created at record
OL,13,Fspeed as the death toll is rising at a
OL,14,Fworrying speed in Africa and there is
OL,15,Fcurrently no effective treatment.
OL,17,FFive volunteers have come forward so
OL,18,Ffar but 50 are needed to complete the
OL,19,Ftrial.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
