OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786029507
OL,3,CFirst human volunteers recruited for
OL,4,Cground breaking vaccine
OL,6,FThe vaccine is being developed using
OL,7,Fthe same technology as the AstraZeneca
OL,8,FCovid 19 vaccine which was given to
OL,9,Fhundreds of millions of people during
OL,10,Fthe pandemic.
OL,12,FProfessor Teresa Lambe, who is leading
OL,13,Fthe team at the University of Oxford
OL,14,Fsaid: "The advantage of being able to
OL,15,Fuse the technology is that we can go
OL,16,Frapidly, we can go fast.
OL,18,F"It's really important to say that we
OL,19,Fare doing all the normal tests and
OL,20,Fsafety steps that we would do with any
OL,21,Fvaccine.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786029507
OL,3,CFirst human volunteers recruited for
OL,4,Cground breaking vaccine
OL,6,F"When you see the number of cases and
OL,7,Fthe deaths and fatalities going up, it
OL,8,Freally brings it home to the team and
OL,9,Fwhat we're trying to do globally is
OL,10,Fmake an impact and try and stop this
OL,11,Foutbreak."
OL,13,FThe vaccine works by putting a
OL,14,Ffragment of genetic material from the
OL,15,FEbola Virus into a harmless virus.
OL,16,FThis is then modified and given to the
OL,17,Fvolunteer.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786029507
OL,3,CFirst human volunteers recruited for
OL,4,Cground breaking vaccine
OL,6,FElysia Traynor, one of the first
OL,7,Fvolunteers to have stepped forward,
OL,8,Fsaid: "It's nice to be able to help
OL,9,Fout with research that's happening
OL,10,Flocally."
OL,12,FThe hope is the patient will develop
OL,13,Fan immune response, but there is no
OL,14,Frisk of developing Ebola.
OL,16,FHowever, it is possible the vaccine
OL,17,Fdoes carry a very low risk of blood
OL,18,Fclots as the AstraZeneca Covid19
OL,19,Fvaccine did, but scientists are
OL,20,Fstressing that this risk is very low
OL,21,Fand it is being very closely monitored.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786029507
OL,3,CFirst human volunteers recruited for
OL,4,Cground breaking vaccine
OL,6,FSevere side effects are very rare and
OL,7,Fall volunteers are fully briefed of
OL,8,Fall the risks.
OL,10,FIn total, 50 healthy adult volunteers
OL,11,Faged 18-55 are needed.
OL,13,FThey will all be monitored for a year,
OL,14,Fbut scientists will know very quickly
OL,15,Fwhether the vaccine is creating the
OL,16,Fright kind of immune response and any
OL,17,Funexpected side effects.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786029507
OL,3,CFirst human volunteers recruited for
OL,4,Cground breaking vaccine
OL,6,FThere are three other vaccines being
OL,7,Fdeveloped around the world against
OL,8,Fthis strain of Ebola but this is the
OL,9,Ffirst to go into human trials and
OL,10,Fmanufacture is already underway.
OL,12,FThe Serum Institute in India has made
OL,13,F600,00 doses of the Oxford Ebola
OL,14,Fvaccine, which are ready to be used if
OL,15,Fthe trials prove successful.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
